<p>When gaining a combo point, you have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">17%, 36%, 46%, 52%, 56%</acronym> chance to gain an extra combo point. Additionally, every time you earn a combo point, you will regain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.52, 1.82, 2.60, 3.14, 3.55</acronym> stamina, or <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.05, 3.63, 5.19, 6.28, 7.10</acronym> stamina if you would exceed 5 combo points.</p>